{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/5c106847c8ea638610d4aa3ad0aa956b.poster.avif?t=1763834364\" width=630 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/5c106847c8ea638610d4aa3ad0aa956b.webm?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/5c106847c8ea638610d4aa3ad0aa956b.mp4?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vale's Echo is a 2D cozy horror adventure game blending dark comedy, psychological themes, and surreal art.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vale died. Then the underworld called and said, \u201cWelcome to your problems, part two.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wakes up on a train to nowhere. No pulse. No past. No clue. Her only company? Echo - a floating skull full of secrets, charm, and just the right amount of mischief. But the underworld isn\u2019t empty. The landlord is a leech. Literally. The hermit thinks you\u2019d taste great with salt. And somewhere in the dark, every fear Vale ever buried is waiting to say hello.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore surreal encounters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bargain with leeches, chat with fish-human hybrids, and meet creatures who test your morals - and your sense of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/b36f8b765c2742764d1b4f27e6e542b9.poster.avif?t=1763834364\" width=630 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/b36f8b765c2742764d1b4f27e6e542b9.webm?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/b36f8b765c2742764d1b4f27e6e542b9.mp4?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crack unsettling puzzles.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook an unearthly dinner for a hungry hermit, unlock cursed luggage, and outwit the underworld\u2019s strange logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/c9848d77e561aaaedd09d2e448c1dcd5.poster.avif?t=1763834364\" width=630 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/c9848d77e561aaaedd09d2e448c1dcd5.webm?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/c9848d77e561aaaedd09d2e448c1dcd5.mp4?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pet the beasts.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may have crooked teeth. They might bite. Try anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/4ed5f228054bad38d76f23cba5ec7cba.poster.avif?t=1763834364\" width=630 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/4ed5f228054bad38d76f23cba5ec7cba.webm?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/4ed5f228054bad38d76f23cba5ec7cba.mp4?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape Vale's fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogue and meaningful choices weave her relationships, memories, and ultimate ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/c2ed2d6784bcac7a3604871106fa5ee1.poster.avif?t=1763834364\" width=630 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/c2ed2d6784bcac7a3604871106fa5ee1.webm?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/c2ed2d6784bcac7a3604871106fa5ee1.mp4?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Seek peace\u2026 or don\u2019t. Some truths are worse than dying.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/952bcd83696724531b4b5fc0a7a83c68.poster.avif?t=1763834364\" width=630 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/952bcd83696724531b4b5fc0a7a83c68.webm?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/952bcd83696724531b4b5fc0a7a83c68.mp4?t=1763834364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564990?t=1763834364","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/fff45c2b4bc0c5e84618d1e81a4f012be007b6bc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763834364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/e3b2f466201af67dcafe6afe476daa895b445495/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763834364","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor